name dirtytalk
category Package
revision 20520
shortdesc A package to typeset quotations easier
relocated 1
longdesc The package provides a macro to typeset quotations, using the
longdesc command \say{stuff}. The quotation mark glyphs are inserted by
longdesc the macro; nested quotations are detected.
